        {
            "block_label": "vision_footnote",
            "block_content": "NOTE 4 Table 19 contains the TPM Key Profiles for the default ECC algorithm as defined by [V2G20-2321]. Further ECC algorithms supported by TPM 2.0 are specified in TCG algorithm registry. Once the specifications add support for Curve448, the implementers can follow the TPM 2.0 specifications to define the TPM key profiles for X448 (alternative ECC algorithm according to [V2G20-2319]) by adjusting the respective parameters in Table 19. The parameters specific to the curve type that need to be updated by the TPM key profiles include the fields \"nameAlg\", \"authPolicy\", \"curveID\" and \"Unique\".",
